When you press ! and it summons a new shell, which is the devnull
login script, the script will try to kill -HUP the running nethack
process and wait for 5 seconds in the hope that nethack could save
your game automatically.  It highly depends on how long it takes to
HUP kill the nethack process.  I can't see a better way to do that
other than completely forbid ! in nethack.  My advice is that if you
see the login script tells you your games is not saved correctly,
don't resume the game.  Logout and login again.

